        {
          "text": "Omwami Hesekia ebaasia ali lino liboola lili kumuleembe kucha khubao ne buliindi bulayi mu siise sie bulamu bwewe, nio akobosia Isaya ali, “Elomo niyo wama khumboolela, khukhwama khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi eli endayi.”",
          "type": "text",
